<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: #0b2343;
        padding: 32px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header .greeting {
        color: #facc15;
        font-size: 26px;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .header .congrats {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 18px;
        margin: 8px 0 0;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .body p {
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      .level-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #fef3c7;
        color: #92400e;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 6px 18px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.4px;
        margin: 0 4px;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #0b2343;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 12px 22px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 16px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f3f4f6;
        padding: 18px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <p class="greeting">{{l1Congrats}}</p>
        <p class="congrats">Congratulations, {{learnerName}}!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>{{l1Greeting}} {{learnerName}},</p>

        <p>
          You have moved up from
          <span class="level-badge">{{oldLevel}}</span>
          to
          <span class="level-badge">{{newLevel}}</span>. This is a real
          achievement — your tutor and the Amber team are proud of the work you
          have put in.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your next set of learning goals at
          <strong>{{newLevel}}</strong>
          is ready in your dashboard. Take a moment to look at them when you
          sign in — they show what we will focus on next.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">Open my dashboard</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          Keep going. We are here whenever you are ready for the next session.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        ©
        {{currentYear}}
        Amber Training. Automated message — please do not reply directly.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>